  <data name="DemoDescription2" xml:space="preserve"><value>Our ghosts are made of bedsheets, and all their scares are optional. Little visitors welcome!</value></data>
  <data name="DemoDescription3" xml:space="preserve"><value>A cobweb-covered doorway and a creaking gate. Brave visitors can meet our cardboard spider.</value></data>
  <data name="DemoDescription4" xml:space="preserve"><value>A gentle monster party for the smallest trick-or-treaters. Costumes encouraged, never required.</value></data>
  <data name="DemoDescription5" xml:space="preserve"><value>The cauldron is bubbling with pretend potions. Ask our resident witch for a Halloween riddle.</value></data>
  <data name="DemoDescription6" xml:space="preserve"><value>A lantern-lit path leads to the door. A relaxed visit with decorations but no sudden surprises.</value></data>
  <data name="DemoDescription7" xml:space="preserve"><value>Bats, shadows, and a spooky soundtrack. This stop is best for families who enjoy a fright.</value></data>
  <data name="DemoDescription8" xml:space="preserve"><value>Bright paper decorations and friendly skeletons. Stop by for a festive neighbourhood hello.</value></data>
  <data name="DemoDescription9" xml:space="preserve"><value>The pumpkin patch has gone to sleep for the evening. Enjoy the decorations from the path.</value></data>
